{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54175","headline":"上洞山颂 · 慧寂","name":"上洞山颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何代隐荒丘，茅堂独寝幽。\n随缘三事衲，顿觉万缘休。\n貌古因持戒，身贫爲少求。\n吾师登鸟量，物外绝追游。\n（《天圣广灯录》卷十二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧寂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}